        "id": 1043845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-17T23:27:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Alright. tbh that pretty much all went over my head since I don\u0027t know anything about binder, but I\u0027ll defer to the experts (you folks) on this 😊\n\nOther people on API council have a better understanding of binder, so we\u0027ll refer back to this thread when we go over it as a group.",
      "parentUuid": "1060e727_2cc09641",
      "revId": "05491648de2e0e87e060d0a932aad73a6d4e9745",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
