      },
      "lineNbr": 112,
      "author": {
        "id": 1644679
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-17T18:22:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that\u0027s reasonable. \n\nThese are all cases where the caller is pretty clearly doing something wrong and they wouldn\u0027t be doing anything differently based on the status value outside of logging the reason for debugging (which we already do underneath the API in libbinder_ndk or libbinder).\n\n@smoreland@google.com are you OK with us aborting in these cases for the libbinder_ndk APIs? These are done in the same process responsible for the error, and each of the errors are logged already.",
      "parentUuid": "f1a924b0_bf826954",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 111,
        "startChar": 46,
        "endLine": 112,
        "endChar": 69
