        "id": 1043845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-16T22:35:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Either `register`/`unregister` or `set` and `set` with `nullptr`: go/android-ndk-api-guidelines#callbacks-setcallback go/android-ndk-api-guidelines#callbacks-register-unregister\n\nAside from the naming, it also says:\n\n\u003e Register \u0026 unregister must use the pair of function pointer + void* as the unique key. As in, it must support registering the same function pointer with different void* userData.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 114,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 114,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "05491648de2e0e87e060d0a932aad73a6d4e9745",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
